in beverage technology. With maximum colour and zero taste, Glurp gives our athletes the edge when competing in the games.<br><br><br>*******************<br><br><br>PC Gamer<br>\u201cThe soundtrack of Drink More Glurp is the hoots and gasps of your friends, and when someone figures out a new trick, or overcomes the seemingly impossible, the mood is absolutely electric.\u201d<br><br>EDGE magazine<br>\u201cWe can see this becoming a party favourite\u201d \u201cThe sponsorship structure is a stroke of brilliance.\u201d<br><br>RockPaperShotgun<br>\u201cWhen I won a round, I chugged my whole can of glurp and loosed a dreadful, ululating bellow like a wookie\u201d<br><br>Kotaku UK<br>\u201cSimple concepts matched with a constantly changing rulebook make this an outstanding party game.\u201d",
